      "writtenOn": "2023-01-26T21:29:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How did you get 30%, then? When you set duty \u003d 30%, you get rpm \u003d 2200? How much does it deviate between two units? Maybe rpm_min isn\u0027t really right (or not true to the spec)? I\u0027m still not convinced max duty and min duty can\u0027t be calculated (with some reasonable error margin).",
      "parentUuid": "4a473ccb_0b031cce",
