      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Poornima, \n\nI understand duty_min is from the spec. So, I think we should have it in the EC. Can you please add it to struct fan_rpm so that each board can customize it? This should fix the stalled bug.\n\nRegarding duty_max, I think the EC should assume it\u0027s 100% and the AP should reduce it to a lower value as needed for whatever reason.\n\nAlso, can you respond to https://issuetracker.google.com/266221111#comment3? I\u0027m wondering how bad or good it is to map duty\u003d[1:100] to pwm\u003d[30:100] instead of clamping.",
